5.0.5.0

- Choose which microphone Lucid Voice uses, follow the Windows default automatically, or pin a specific microphone.
- New Only while gaming option turns Lucid on when a game starts and off when it ends without fighting manual choices.
- Game Mode options are grouped behind a cleaner disclosure, with corrected keyboard focus rings and wrapped settings text.
- Lucid Voice now updates its audio component cleanly across app versions, preserves working setups when an update fails, and keeps tone saving consistent.
- Repair now separates device setup from live processing, warns when Windows audio enhancements may prevent processing, and includes recent Equalizer APO diagnostic evidence or a clear administrator instruction.
- Fixed an EQ filter that Equalizer APO could skip.
